abstract: >-
  A working guide to the ILM, PANINI and Zistgah stack, as a website, a PDF and one Markdown
  file: the repositories and their DOIs, exact set-up commands, and the mathematics of encodings,
  reversible transliteration, Panini's grammar, compilers, hardware and quantum substrates, with
  every example executed while the guide was built.
